much.\\\\n\\\\nThe service was amazing as well, shout-out to Adrian! I need to come back here on my next visit to Santa Barbara!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the provided structured data, here is an objective overview of Flor De Maiz:\\n\\nFlor De Maiz is a popular Mexican restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California. With a rating of 4.0 stars, the restaurant offers a variety of dishes, including tacos, burritos, and margaritas. The establishment has both indoor and outdoor seating areas, providing a beautiful view of the surrounding area. Customers have praised the restaurant's complimentary chips and salsa, which are considered some of the best in town. The tacos de camaron and taquitos de pato en mole coloradito have also received high praise, with customers enjoying the generous portion sizes and flavorful ingredients. Additionally, the esquites Mexicanos have been described as delicious, with perfect seasoning and presentation. The customer service at Flor De Maiz has been consistently praised, with friendly and attentive staff. Overall, Flor De Maiz is a great choice for those looking for a satisfying and flavorful Mexican dining experience in Santa Barbara.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
