ust and peel in the first 2-3 days.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how long does it take to heal from a chemical peel\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the given passages, the healing time for a chemical peel can range from 1 to 14 days, depending on the depth of the peel. A deep peel can take between 10 to 14 days for skin regrowth, with the skin remaining red for up to 3 weeks or even 2 months for some individuals. Most people take about 2 weeks off from work.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
