od and reasonable prices, mentioning that it was great for families. The restaurant has attributes such as outdoor seating and WiFi, but no reservations or validation for parking. Overall, the reviews suggest that the quality of the food and dining experience may be inconsistent, but some customers have had positive experiences.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
