tly browned. Brush the tops lightly with olive oil, push dents into the surface of the dough rectangles, and spread 1/3 cup pizza sauce on top. Serve with extra pizza sauce for dipping.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
