 quality of their food, mentioning that their order was missing key components and lacked flavor. These incidents left the customers dissatisfied.\\n\\nHowever, not all reviews were negative. One customer praised the restaurant's Torta Ahogada, describing it as amazing and authentic Mexican food. They enjoyed the spicy sauce used in the dish.\\n\\nOverall, Mayo's Carniceria & Tacos has received a rating of 3.5 stars. While some customers have had negative experiences with the quality of the food and ingredients, others have found certain dishes to be enjoyable.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
