lse,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Mexican, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mayo's Carniceria & Tacos\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-01-24 06:15:13\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"DONT GO!! Disgusting! A few months ago i went in and bought some meat. When i got home it was green with some mold growing and smelled horrible!! I went back to return it and to get my money back and the owner got mad and told me that that's how its supposed to be! Like really C'mon! Im not dumb i know when meat is bad ive been cooking all my life. Their meat display is so low quality and not at the right temperatures, so much cross contamination with red meats and chicken. Their \\\\\\\"fresh\\\\\\\" produce are always warm and never fresh. They always sell bad and rotten veggies. Another incident that happened, a few days ago i went to buy a soda. A soda cant go bad. YEAH RIGHT! I got the soda all the way from the back it was hot (whatever ill put it in the fridge when i get home) when i opened the soda there was no gas i tasted it and it was SO concentrated, all sugar i had to throw away! Just simply dont go here and don't consume there foods.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-12-04 00:08:16\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"The food we got was horrible.  I ordered a Torta and it was dry and tasteless.  I got takeout and it was missing the beans/rice cart blanche order.  My wife's combo of an enchilada and taco was missing its beans/rice.  No sauce in the enchilada-- terrible, terrible, terrible.  And add to this insult -- no napkins or plastic utensils.  I only hoe is that we don't get sick from the meal.  I didn't eat much of the meal -- so sad.  So for $23 I got no satisfaction.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-10-09 06:26:27\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Their Torta Ahogada is amazing! Now this is Mexican food. The sauce they use is spicy spicy but that good heat you get mad at your mouth for not being able to handle it because you want to keep on eating.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Mayo's Carniceria & Tacos is a local business located at 2704 De La Vina St in Santa Barbara, CA. It is a Mexican restaurant that offers a variety of dishes. The business operates from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM every day of the week. The establishment does not have a garage for parking, but street parking is available. There is no outdoor seating, and the restaurant does not provide WiFi. However, they do offer takeout services.\\n\\nAccording to customer reviews, Mayo's Carniceria & Tacos has received mixed feedback. One customer had a negative experience with the quality of their meat and produce. They found mold on the meat they purchased and encountered cross-contamination issues. Another customer complained about the poor quality of their food, mentioning that their order was missing key components and lacked flavor. These incidents left the customers dissatisfied.\\n\\nHowever, not all reviews were negative. One customer praised the restaurant's Torta Ahogada, describing it as amazing and authentic Mexican food. They enjoyed the spicy sauce used in the dish.\\n\\nOverall, Mayo's Carniceria & Tacos has received a rating of 3.5 stars. While some customers have had negative experiences with the quality of the food and ingredients, others have found certain dishes to be enjoyable.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
