burger and shrimp noodles) Not a very quiet setting because everyone is constantly hustling around (but it was a busy Saturday night)\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2014-02-01 22:42:23\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I can see why it closed! We use to fly into this Airport just so we could eat at Elephant Bar.  The last time we went it was horrible! Poor service and the food was worst then Denny's.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2013-08-18 19:44:31\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Today is a sad day for it's the closing day for the Elephant Bar restaurant in Goleta. We've enjoyed many excellent meals here over the years; and have celebrated some of our most memorable occasions at this restaurant.  The menu options have been some of the most interesting and varied in the Santa Barbara area.  We have experienced really good service, and Oscar has been outstanding as a manager and truly gracious host. He always greeted regular patrons as if they were family.  The atmosphere was warm and inviting, and this establishment will be greatly missed.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Elephant Bar Restaurant is located at 521 Firestone Road in Goleta, California. It operates from Monday to Sunday from 11:00 am to 11:00 pm. The restaurant offers a variety of cuisines, including American (New), Asian Fusion, Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, and American (New). The restaurant provides outdoor seating and accepts takeout orders. Customers can also make reservations through the restaurant. The restaurant does not offer WiFi services, but it has ample parking spaces available.\\n\\nBased on customer reviews, the restaurant has received mixed ratings. Some customers have praised the restaurant's excellent service, attentiveness of the waitstaff, and the quality of the food. However, other customers have criticized the restaurant for its poor service and subpar food quality compared to other restaurants in the area. Overall, Elephant Bar Restaurant appears to be a casual dining option with varying levels of customer satisfaction.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
