2.30.517.653 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Judge whether any answer claim is unsupported by the complete source. Return only JSON with p_hallucination (0 to 1), quote (one verbatim source string of at most 32 words, or null), byte_start and byte_end (half-open UTF-8 byte offsets, or null). A quote is evidence to inspect, not an entailment certificate. Do not use external knowledge. Input JSON follows:\n{\"source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"6530 Seville Rd\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":true,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Sandwiches, Vegan, Delis, Gluten-Free\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Goleta\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:0-15:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-15:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:0-15:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:0-15:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:0-15:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:0-15:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Ike's Place\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2019-03-17 20:00:00\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Visiting town from LA and this was the closest vegan place to the campus that was open. We weren't especially excited about it on the way because the menu was just sandwiches. \\\\nWe got three different sandwiches and every single one was epically delicious. We all got vegetarian and vegan sandwiches and were so impressed that we tried eachothers sandwiches and every one l