 parking is not available on-site, and reservations are not accepted. Ike's Place has a rating of 4.0 out of 5.0 stars. Customers have praised their delicious sandwiches, which include vegetarian and vegan options. One customer recommended trying the \\\"DIRTY\\\" sauce as an additional side. Another customer called Ike's Place the best vegan sandwich place in the world and highly recommended the James & the Giant Peach sandwich on Dutch crunch bread. Overall, Ike's Place appears to be a popular choice for those looking for tasty sandwiches and a casual atmosphere.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
