tive hazard. It can enter the body either through the skin or lungs, especially in areas with high concentrations of phenol in the air.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
