\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Burgers, Cafes, Restaurants, Mexican, American (Traditional)\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Goleta\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:30\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"8:0-20:30\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cal Taco\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-21 03:05:15\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Food is amazing great service usually BUT 30 mins ago had the worst experience a young lady took my phone order she was so rude I heard her cussing under her breath then I went to pick up my food order was wrong she fixed it but made me pay the original bill she rung up gave her a forty she gave me my change she was gonna reimbursed me but didn't know math for shit and argued with me I just said whatever got tipped off 6 dollars\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-19 23:50:52\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Nothing fancy, but adobado burrito and tacos are on point! Decent price, big portions.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-04 01:55:53\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"If you like the spot in Carpinteria you'll like this place for burgers. Even though it has taco in its name people come here for the burgers. I like how they give a good amount of veggies and raw onions on the burger. You can chose to get a add your choice of American, cheddar, or Jack cheese. The burger is delicious. The fried here are fatter than McDonald's or other fast food so it has nice texture when you take your food to go back to SB. I like how the employee provided some suggestions when I asked what was good.  I was recommended carnitas nachos but I opted for chicken. I wish I grabbed some salsa from the salsa bar.... bit the nachos came with one sour cream and one guacamole container. The nachos were a little salty compared to what I normally eat but I'm the flavor was good and had a nice lemon/lime flavor to the chicken. If you come by...I recommend trying out the burgers and maybe a pitcher of beer- I would have ordered it, but don't think they do it to go.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Cal Taco is a local business located at 7320 Hollister Ave, Ste 1 in Goleta, CA. The restaurant offers a variety of cuisines, including Burgers, Cafes, Restaurants, Mexican, and American (Traditional). It operates from Tuesday to Sunday, from 8:00 AM to 8:30 PM. The business has parking available in a lot, and it also provides outdoor seating. However, there is no WiFi available at the restaurant.\\n\\nCustomers have given Cal Taco an average rating of 4.0 stars. One recent review mentioned a negative experience with a rude employee who took the phone order and made mistakes with the food order and the bill. Another review highlighted the delicious adobado burrito and tacos, praising the decent prices and generous portions. Additionally, customers appreciate the burgers offered at Cal Taco, with the option to choose from American, cheddar, or Jack cheese. The fries are described as having a nice texture compared to other fast food options.\\n\\nOverall, Cal Taco is known for its diverse menu options, including burgers, Mexican cuisine, and American classics. The restaurant has received positive feedback for its tasty food, although there have been some issues with customer service.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
