, take out services, or WiFi. The ambience of the place is not specifically categorized, and it does not provide business parking. The business has an average rating of 4.0 stars. Based on customer reviews, patrons have mixed feelings about the establishment. Some appreciated the drinks and found it a fun spot for karaoke, while others were unsure about its identity as a restaurant or a bar. The food was found to be forgettable by one customer, and another mentioned that the dinner menu did not match the price and size. Despite these mixed reviews, some customers expressed willingness to return.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
