 share your thoughts with me in the comments section below. Remember to follow me to read more of my content.\", \"answer\": \"The Young and the Restless spoilers suggest Nick Newman (Joshua Morrow) will break up with Sally Spectra (Courtney Hope) over her kiss with Adam Newman (Mark Grossman). Nick believes Sally still harbours feelings for Adam, despite Sally's assurances that she's not in love with him yet. After their breakup, Adam increases his advances towards Sally, seeing it as a sign they should be together. Nick hopes Sally will eventually find happiness and contentment in her choice.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
