\\\nWe had a primo time here and the server was friendly and pleasant and more to the point, efficient.\\\\nCheers to the Tee Off and Happy New Year.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-25 20:48:45\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Always my favorite spot in Santa Barbara for prime rib and clam chowder.  GreT spot great staff and great food\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-16 04:18:05\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I was lucky enough to stumble upon this gem a few months back and I've been coming every week since starting this gig in Santa Barbara. Great Prime Rib, stiff cocktails, and some dam good Chowder. Todd is our usual bartender but this gal Sarah is a young and rising star behind the bar!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Sure! Here's an objective overview of Tee-Off Restaurant and Lounge based on the provided structured data:\\n\\nTee-Off Restaurant and Lounge is a local favorite in Santa Barbara, offering a versatile menu of Nightlife, Restaurants, Steakhouses, and Bars. With a rating of 4.0 stars and over 300 reviews, this establishment has consistently delivered high-quality food and drinks to its patrons. The restaurant is open Monday through Sunday, with hours varying by day, and offers Outdoor Seating and WiFi.\\n\\nThe menu features a range of options, including Prime Rib, Steak, Seafood, and Pasta, all made with fresh ingredients and expert preparation. The restaurant is particularly known for its signature dishes, such as the saut\u00e9ed mushrooms and prime rib, which have received rave reviews from patrons. The bar serves a variety of cocktails and drinks, including martinis and garlic bread.\\n\\nThe atmosphere is casual and intimate, with a divey and hipster vibe, according to some reviewers. However, the restaurant also caters to families and groups, with a romantic and classy ambiance. The service is professional and efficient, although some reviewers have noted that the service can be inconsistent depending on the server.\\n\\nMany reviewers have praised the restaurant for its excellent food, generous portions, and heavy pours. Some have also commended the friendly and pleasant service, particularly from bartender Todd. Overall, Tee-Off Restaurant and Lounge is a popular destination for locals and visitors alike, offering a delightful dining experience with great food, drinks, and atmosphere.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
