losing? The rent is too high? When are people going to realize that there are some things (think tradition) that trump the almighty dollar!  Wow! Perhaps with a little luck it will be replaced with an IHOP, Coco's, or, better yet, another (insert plastic fast food emporium here) because we sure need another one of them (think breakfast tacos?) Yucch. This evening just made a turn for the worst. So sad.........\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the provided structured data, here is an objective overview of Esau's Cafe:\\n\\nEsau's Cafe is a popular restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California, offering a variety of dining options including Restaurants, Coffee & Tea, Food, Breakfast & Brunch, and Diners. With a rating of 4.0 out of 5 stars, the business has received positive reviews for its excellent service and delicious food.\\n\\nAccording to the reviews, the salads and biscuits at Esau's are particularly notable, with customers praising the generous portion sizes and high quality of the ingredients. However, the business has recently faced closure due to rent increases, which have caused disappointment among long-time customers. Despite this setback, Esau's remains a beloved institution in the Santa Barbara community, known for its cozy atmosphere and friendly service.\\n\\nEsau's offers both indoor and outdoor seating, free WiFi, and takes reservations, making it a convenient and comfortable dining option for locals and visitors alike. While the business does not offer parking validation or valet services, there is street parking available nearby. Overall, Esau's Cafe is a well-regarded dining spot in Santa Barbara, offering a range of delicious food and drink options in a relaxed and inviting setting.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
