 Mom. Pad Thai Chicken & Shrimp for me. $16 dollars, no drinks. Why did I wander away from my normal order? The pad thai was...ehhhh so-so. Kung Pao was pretty good, Rice was gross. Took 15 mins to get the food and no one was in there. I've had it before when I would have given 4 stars. Won't be rushing back.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the provided structured data, here is an objective overview of Pick Up Stix:\\n\\nPick Up Stix is a Chinese restaurant located in Goleta, California, with a rating of 3.5 out of 5 stars. The restaurant offers a variety of options including Chinese, Fast Food, and Restaurants. While some customers appreciate the convenience and quality of the food, others have complained about the price and service. Reviews mention that the restaurant is clean and has friendly staff, but the portions can be underwhelming and the wait time is relatively long. Customers also note that the food is not as good as other Chinese restaurants they have tried. Despite these drawbacks, many customers still find Pick Up Stix to be a good option for quick and decent food.\"}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
