ing interpretations of what constitutes freedom of worship. Ultimately, the experiences and perceptions of the four freedoms varied across different groups, shaped by their distinct histories, beliefs, and struggles.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
