s, the business has received mixed feedback. One customer mentioned experiencing unfriendly staff, an unclean bathroom, and incorrect drink orders. They were also disappointed to be asked to leave an hour before the posted closing time. However, another customer praised the establishment for its late-night dining options, vibrant atmosphere, and helpful server named Hilary. They enjoyed the outdoor patio and recommended the Westside Gin Cocktails, Beef Sliders, Mac Daddy, and Chicken Bites. Another customer appreciated the friendly staff, great food, and the inviting outdoor patio.\\n\\nOverall, Seven Bar & Kitchen has a rating of 4.0 stars. While there were some negative experiences, the positive review highlighted the potential for a enjoyable dining experience with good food and attentive service.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
