service was fast.  \\\\n\\\\nWe ended up eating at the market because it wasn't very crowded and it was just an over all great experience.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-19 22:18:31\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I love a good falafel sandwich. This was Top Notch! I ordered two spicy Falafel sandwiches. (I had one a couple days ago and zipped back for a repeat order. The falafel was actually spicy (vs salty spicy and spicy for wimps). It was crunchy in the outside and tender on the inside. The veg mix was super spot on! The extra hot sauce was freaking amazing and I emptied it! Tahini sauce was as perfect as could be. I might just revisit one more time before we leave SB. Sorry for not sharing pics; I didn't take the time away from my amazing lunch!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-27 21:29:38\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Kale falafel burger was absolutely incredible. I've never really actively sought out vegan food, but this has made me start rethinking that. Super great flavor, and so nice to look at!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Fala Bar is a local business located at 38 W Victoria St, Ste 108 in Santa Barbara, CA. This restaurant offers a variety of vegan and gluten-free options, specializing in falafel, Mediterranean cuisine, salads, and sandwiches. The establishment is open from 11:30 am to 4:30 pm on Mondays, and from 11:30 am to 9:00 pm from Tuesday to Sunday.\\n\\nCustomers have left positive reviews about their experiences at Fala Bar. One reviewer mentioned that they were not vegan but still enjoyed the food, finding it delicious and satisfying. They specifically enjoyed the avocado burger and kale burger, noting that the portions were generous. The staff was friendly, and the service was fast. Another customer praised the falafel sandwiches, highlighting their spiciness, crunchiness, and flavorful vegetable mix. They also appreciated the amazing hot sauce and tahini sauce. Additionally, a reviewer expressed their satisfaction with the kale falafel burger, stating that it had incredible flavor and was visually appealing.\\n\\nOverall, Fala Bar has received positive feedback for its tasty and satisfying vegan options. The restaurant offers a pleasant dining experience with friendly service. With its convenient location and diverse menu, it is a great choice for those seeking vegan and gluten-free options in Santa Barbara.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
