tion. He intends to allow Matt to explain himself before deciding to target him next.\\nBB25 fans, do you think Blue will get any votes to stay on Thursday's live eviction? Keep watching Big Brother 25, airing on CBS and streaming Paramount Plus. Please share your thoughts with me in the comments section below. Remember to follow me to read more of my content.\", \"answer\": \"In the latest episode of Big Brother 25, Felica exposes Cirie's voting plan to Jag, causing chaos in the house. Felica tells Jag that Cirie wants to force a tie-breaking vote to send Blue Kim home. Jag, who is the current Head of Household, plans to tell Blue that she is leaving on eviction night to avoid her becoming a bitter jury member. Felica also fears that Cirie's plan was to expose her as the one who voted to keep Blue, making her a target next week. Jag plans to discuss targeting Matt during the double eviction.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
