t want to share. For another $1 you can get vanilla ice cream at the bottom.  Enjoy.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-08-20 01:09:41\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I ordered the Rainbow, which had pineapple and blue raspberry flavor, and it was delicious. I even added ice cream at the bottom which enlightened the whole treat! Very clean and sanitary with a lovely lady running the booth. Also the fact that an International Harvester Scout 2 was pulling the trailer made me enjoy my cold treat by tenfold\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Penelope's Sno Balls at the Beach is a food truck located at 200 Linden Ave in Carpinteria, California. The truck serves as a restaurant and offers shaved ice, desserts, hot dogs, and food. The business has a 5.0 rating based on reviews and positive feedback from customers. The truck offers outdoor seating and does not have WiFi or parking available. Some customers have praised the quality of the shaved ice and hot dogs, while others have noted the excellent location on the beach. Prices are reasonable, with large portions available for sharing.\"}"}], "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 70555, "max_tokens": 128, "cache_prompt": false, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
