esentation of Jesus reflects the changing complexion of America and the desire for authenticity in historical storytelling. However, these depictions may still fall short of accuracy, as the Bible describes Jesus as having short hair, unlike the long-haired depictions commonly seen in media.\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
